# Owezy core rules

## Stack — do not deviate without an ADR

- API: NestJS (TypeScript) in `apps/api/`
- Admin web: Next.js App Router in `apps/admin-web/`
- User web: Next.js App Router in `apps/user-web/`
- Mobile: Flutter + GetX in `apps/mobile/` — **in scope for MVP**
- Do not introduce other frameworks (BLoC, GetIt, go_router, Express, Remix, React Native) without an ADR in `docs/decisions/`

## Spec before code

No feature code without ALL of these:
1. Approved feature spec in `specs/features/`
2. Approved architecture in `specs/architecture/`
3. OpenAPI stub in `specs/openapi/`

Run `/spec-build <id|description>` for one story, or `/spec-build-batch <id>…` for multiple issues on one branch + PR.

## OpenAPI is the contract

All API shapes live in `specs/openapi/`. Never invent an endpoint or change a schema without updating the spec first.

## Design system

`packages/design-system/` for web runtime imports (CSS/TS tokens). Never hardcode hex, rem, or px values. Flutter uses `lib/core/theme/` mirrors.

Design handoffs (mandatory before UI work):
- user-web → `resources/owezy-web/`
- admin-web → `resources/owezy-admin-console/`
- mobile → `resources/owezy-mobile/`

Read screenshots + `*.dc.html` (and mobile `DESIGN_SPEC.md`) before implementing. Match mocks; do not invent parallel UI. Stale paths `resources/web-user/` and `resources/mobile/` must never be used.

## Financial integrity

- Expenses, splits, and settlements are source of truth; balances are derived.
- No financial data, balances, or user amounts in logs, comments, or test fixtures.
- Soft deletes on all syncable entities (`deleted_at` column).
- Client-generated UUIDs for syncable entities.

## Monorepo layout

```
apps/api, apps/admin-web, apps/user-web, apps/mobile
packages/design-system, packages/shared-types
specs/, docs/, .agents/skills/
```

Do not create new top-level directories without team agreement.
